      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/e/9de053/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2013-11-15T00:27:30.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Yeah, it sucks having to wait for the promo pack.&nbsp; In this case, I was actually willing to bust my hump getting these promos right away (having no others), but I ended up having no money at all during the one-weekend window for final preorders (and getting one such extra chance from the &gt;G team was more than could be expected in the first place).&nbsp; So I'll just continue to go without, and thus not have any redundancies when the promo pack is finally a thing.</p>",
